{"ID":"20240314091839-8xc7tfd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091839-8xc7tfd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091839-8xc7tfd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170408-l7icif4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170408-jb8ux4e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:192,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170408-jb8ux4e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:42,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:42\u0026#125;","title":"【大黄牡丹皮汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170408-l7icif4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-l7icif4","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠痈之为病，其身甲错，腹皮急，如肿状，按之濡，时时发热，自汗出，反恶寒。其脉迟紧者，脓未成，可下之。大黄牡丹皮汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-5018cms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-5018cms","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-cl7289s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-cl7289s","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两牡丹一两桃仁五十个瓜子半升芒硝三合"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-hv49ob9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-hv49ob9","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水六升，煮取一升，去滓，内芒硝，再煎沸，顿服之，有脓当下；如无脓，当下血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-h20ufag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-h20ufag","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，大家看这个条辨，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肠痈之为病，其身甲错，腹皮急，如肿状，按之濡，时时发热，自汗出，反恶寒，其脉迟紧者，脓未成，可下之，大黄牡丹汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果脉洪数者，脓已成，不可下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-u6udyyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-u6udyyk","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 212px;","style":"width: 202px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240411144126-wfu9zx9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 202px;\" parent-style=\"width: 212px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-vc2ame6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-vc2ame6","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个腹部呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹皮汤，专门治疗肠痈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是急性盲肠炎。那老师，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道他急性盲肠炎？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他有实症在这边的时候，当然，痛是第一个啦，第二个，你看看这病人，他右边嘛（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如图，患侧在右"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），他把右脚弯起来，那个病人弯右脚干嘛？因为他弯起来比较不痛，就是肠痈。那如果医生不知道，这个病人怎么老是把脚弯到？你还不知道，其实就是肠痈，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肠痈的人腿一定弯到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"足三里下一寸的地方就是阑尾穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这种痛症我们检查非常快，你轻轻一按他就痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-cl2wmwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-cl2wmwa","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果变成脓成的时候，破裂掉的时候，痛就没有了，你一摸上去，这里是烫的，处方就分开来了，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"强烈的痛的时候，诸位呢用大黄牡丹皮汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那老师，我不想用中药，干脆开刀算了，这个阑尾呢把它开掉很简单嘛。你如果开掉了以后，你以为好了，其实没有好，开掉以后呢，这个宿便还是堵在这里（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阑尾处"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）啊，这个（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盲肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）没有了，慢慢越来越大，然后后来大肠头就变成一个袋状的东西停留在这边（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盲肠头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那大便从这边出来直接上去了，这个下面的这个地方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盲肠头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）就一直有大便根深蒂固的留在里面，隐隐做痛，这就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"慢性盲肠炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以在盲肠这一段，阑尾这一段没有啦，你切掉盲肠这一段，那问题更多。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-qobtqht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-qobtqht","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说我们有几个处方，第一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是在阑尾这边的时候，怎么诊断？刚才讲过，处方呢就是大黄牡丹皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果阑尾没有发炎，在这个地方的时候，我们怎么处方？后面都有介绍，大家看大黄牡丹皮汤，大黄4 钱，牡丹1钱，桃仁你可以用 3 钱，冬瓜仁 3 钱，芒硝呢 2 钱，这个大黄，芒硝不煮，其它药6 碗水煮 2 碗，芒硝呢 2 钱分两包，冲服。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-ewdqy4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-ewdqy4f","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方吃下去以后，大便会清出来，痛一直会消，就症就清在这个阑尾的地方。那你如果说，病人躺在床上，你在煮药，那没事干哪，病人脚弯在那边对不对？很痛啊，你下针呢，针那个阑尾点。针一下去，痛就没有了，那脚就可以伸直了。那你不要说没事嘛，然后让他继续痛在那边，对不对？我们不知道针灸穴道也就罢了，知道就要帮他下个针，然后再吃药。那吃药以后这个痛完全没有了，那脚可以伸直了，小便变成淡黄了，就可以停药了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-h0rd9df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-h0rd9df","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造成盲肠炎的原因呢，一般是吃东西太快。那比如吃那个螃蟹，很多的甲壳类的食物哦，没有消化，或者吃西瓜吃太多西瓜的籽没有（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"咬碎或者吐掉？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）...也一起吞下去，还有这个食物的残渣，都是壳类的、或者是种子类的，容易掉在里面。所以吃东西要慢一点哦不要太急。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-2w2mz7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-2w2mz7c","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像大黄是攻坚的，大家都知道的了。牡丹皮呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮呢，是消瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以活血化瘀的时候我们都会用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有去炎热，肠子的热的时候我们会用丹皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桃仁呢，完全是破血用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个胀痛嘛。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"冬瓜仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，在经方里面，我们在前面千金苇茎汤里面介绍冬瓜仁的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以增润这个肺的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，它是仁剂，因为肺跟大肠是表里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-q5sk8qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-q5sk8qn","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻坚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，大家看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方里面没有放甘草的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你如果说你加了枳实跟芒硝，这就是不对症的。为什么？我们希望药力呢直接进入阑尾，你如果加了枳实和厚朴，那小肠、大肠会变成了宽肠，它自我代谢会没有，这自我代谢没有了之后，它变成说大黄牡丹皮呢，大黄跟芒硝变成小承气和大承气。小承气跟大承气在用的时候，把肠子清掉了，阑尾炎还在这边。所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不用枳实也不用厚朴，就是希望药力能够直接透到阑尾上边去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170408-jb8ux4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170408-jb8ux4e","updated":"20240422170408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上碰过很多，同时你下针阑尾穴，针下去之后在病床上就好了，你这边再煮药给他吃哦。"}]}]}